# Bassline 0.2: Shape and Bend. The 808: punch, dive time, character, tail; the Bend knob springs back
wait 100
turn PRESET -1
expect par23 0
# Shape (EDIT from Sound): Punch +12, Dive time long, Character Fold, Tail -12
tap EDIT
expect view 1
spin K1 8
expect par24 12
spin K2 30
expect par25 60
spin K3 2
expect par26 2
spin K4 12
expect par27 12
shot shape.png
# Sound: some drive, for the fold to show
tap HOME
spin K3 40
tap FX
spin K4 12
expect par7 12
peakreset
wav 808_shaped.wav
key 7 down
wait 900
key 7 up
wait 700
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
expect peak_db_min -20
# Bend (EDIT from Glide): the knob bends, and springs back over Return
tap EDIT
expect view 3
key 7 down
wait 30
turn K1 4 10
expect note 36
wait 10
shot bend.png
wait 1500
key 7 up
# Return 0: Hold, the bend stays
spin K2 -20
expect par28 0
# wobble 1/8
spin K3 60
expect par29 60
key 7 down
wav 808_wobble.wav
wait 1200
wavstop
key 7 up
wait 300
# every character, with drive, stays in range
tap SEL
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
expect view 1
spin K3 -2
expect par26 0
